# KAMLunarBand

Root of the certificate application `KAMLunarBand`: SO-2: the Moon's spin-orbit band (N = 65 barrier
tori). An opt-in library (decision D51): a plain `lake build` does not build it; `lake build
KAMLunarBand` does, through the serial capped driver. This file imports the generated parts
`KAMLunarBand.*`, which together import every module that `scripts/build_roots.json` assigns to
`KAMLunarBand`, except the frozen theorem anchors that are still `DRAFT_SORRY` and their provider
modules (built through the library's globs). It is generated by `scripts/gen_root_imports.py`; do
not edit it by hand, and never import it.
